WEBVTT

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.520
Disappearing doesn't just mean 
that your memories disappear.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.950
Your personality disappears, too.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:22.130
I can't fight alongside you when I feel like this.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:33.530
Alteration.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.620
Change.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:35.510
About-face.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:40.030
Inexplicable.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.540
Incomplete information.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:48.910
Hanna-chan?

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:49.900
Interruption.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.140
What do you want?

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:54.660
Unexpected.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.150
That was you, Suzuko-san?

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:58.320
Why are you in the first-year classroom?

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.030
Wait... Joy!

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.090
You'll finally fight me?

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:02.540
Um...

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:05.250
Disappointment.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.490
I guess not.

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:07.800
I'm sorry.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.310
Deadlines.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.500
I don't have time today.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:12.480
Farewell.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:13.310
Wait...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:14.470
I want to ask you something!

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:18.800
Um, about what happens when 
you lose all your coins.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:20.930
Coincidence.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:23.760
I was thinking about the same thing.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:26.840
We have an outing next period.

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:27.540
Let's go.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:28.240
Yeah.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:36.640
I want to do it...

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.670
I want to have a battle.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:14.960
Reunion / Bright Light and Chaos

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.120
Possession.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.930
The LRIG takes over your body.

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.160
The last person I battled

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:28.380
told me about his little sister 
who was a Selector.

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:30.980
Sighting.

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:34.200
I found a similar opponent.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.440
Then it was...

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.020
Uncertain.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:40.110
We should look into this more deeply.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:43.620
I already tried to interrogate Anonymous-chan,

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:44.950
but she told me nothing.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.420
I-Interrogate?

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:47.770
That's right.

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:50.090
Hanna-sama is very tough.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:52.920
All night long, she dripped water 
on me, covered me in oil...

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.850
Just thinking about it makes me shiver.

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:57.840
Hanna-chan, you're kind of amazing.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:00.670
Suggestion.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:03.800
I was actually thinking about something else.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.560
Strategy meeting.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.760
I'll provide a place.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.670
This is...

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:16.930
My room.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.380
Primarily used for writing articles, but...

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.530
All set.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:21.990
This is it.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:23.220
Attention.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.950
A WIXOSS message board.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.990
<b>737  Anonymous Cardman @ Pretty Girl 
Help me, Bookmaker. I'm running out of time. 

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.910
<b>742  Anonymous Cardman @ Pretty Girl 
( '-w- ) Poor guy. 

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.910
The bookmaker?

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.380
Hypothesis.

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:36.000
Somewhere in this city is a person who 
books matches between Selectors.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:40.590
<b>756  Seems like a lie, huh? This is my nickname. 
I can hook you up. E-mail me. 

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.700
Prediction.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:41.380
Someone like that could access 
considerable information.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.470
Including things we don't know yet, most likely.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.290
Acquisition.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:49.850
I gathered all the information 
I have on the bookmaker in a file.

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:55.230
Wow.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.230
You found all this by yourself?

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:58.800
Longing.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:02.530
I want to know the truth behind these battles.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.080
The truth?

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.770
So please...

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.910
Deadline.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.610
I'm busy.

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:17.820
Unexpected.

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.500
Hanna has a friend visiting!

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:20.710
Sister?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.050
Forbidden! Taboo!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.530
I told you so many times not to copy me!

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.610
Hanna finally has a friend!

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:26.990
I'm in tears!

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:28.070
Immediate withdrawal!

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:29.760
Don't interrupt us!

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:32.950
Thanks for being her friend!

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.830
I know she's a bit weird!

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:35.580
Silence.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:36.810
Keep your mouth shut.

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:43.650
I'm home.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.940
They're back late again today, huh?

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:50.700
But I can use the computer now,

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.180
so maybe it's for the best.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:57.410
<b>search thread. 23: WIXOSS Original 

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.410
Here, this is it.

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:59.100
Um...

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.090
<b>I'm looking for the bookmaker.</b>

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.050
<b>Bookmaker 
Can you come to Mejiro Station at 18:00?</b>

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.470
<b>Cheat Sheet</b>

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:16.640
<b>Turn right at 
the second light 
to get to my shop. 
I'll tell you whatever 
you need to know.</b>

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:32.520
Does the bookmaker really exist?

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.180
<i>I don't have any time.</i>

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:41.530
How much do you know, Riru?

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.090
If I ask, will you tell me?

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:46.260
If it's something I can answer.

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:53.000
If you were me, what would 
you want to do, Riru?

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:59.230
I'm just myself. I don't want to be you.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.320
But if I lose my coins—

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.360
That's the battle system.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:06.110
It's not something I want.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.430
It's just a rule.

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:09.940
Damn it! Damn it!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.680
U-Um, you should try to regroup...

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:15.780
Shut up!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.520
This wasn't like he said!

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:21.220
How the hell were they weak?!

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:23.400
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:26.390
It was an easy opponent for us, and I still—

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.840
I said shut up!

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:28.580
Damn it!

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.070
I'm out of time!

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:32.000
Please pick up, Satomi!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.970
<b>Calling 

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:48.940
It's time.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:51.820
I wonder if we'll see him this time.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:55.980
Even if we don't learn anything from him,

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:59.040
we still have to fight, right?

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.230
Obviously.

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:02.000
The coins have limits.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.520
That's right.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.410
Fact.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:06.000
I don't want to disappear.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:10.200
And...

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:14.880
Aren't there any memories you don't want to lose?

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.260
You should fight battles for that reason.

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:18.880
Yeah.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:21.390
I have memories I treasure.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.980
I don't want to lose them.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:24.800
But...

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.190
I know exactly how you feel.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:28.800
Caution!

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:29.780
Who are you?

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:33.380
The bookmaker, Satomi Kou.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:37.950
<b>Satomi Kou</b>

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.950
So, how about it?

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:42.080
Want to bet your worries on me?

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:49.360
Knock on the third toilet stall?

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.380
Am I supposed to be Hanako-san?!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:52.920
Confirmation.

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.150
Is he a Selector?

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:58.940
He's not.

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:00.940
Sorry...

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.390
Still, good work finding all this.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:06.390
I guess a magazine writer isn't like the others.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:07.440
Concern.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:08.520
Why do you know about me?

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:10.820
Dr. Hanna-chan...

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:14.000
I'm a fan of your column.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.860
So I'm really happy to see you today!

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:20.690
Now, let's get to the point.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:23.830
If you've done this much research, 
you must know almost everything, yes?

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.420
That you'll book Selector battles for us...

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.790
Well, yes, put simply.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.550
Demand.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.390
What proof do you have that 
you're the bookmaker?

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:38.580
All you have to do is enter, 
and you'll find out right away.

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:39.890
Okay, you first...

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:42.440
Homura Suzuko-chan, was it?

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.100
Can you tell me how to contact you first?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.020
Remember this one thing.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:51.060
When I set up a battle, you can't refuse it.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.160
We have a relationship, after all.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.000
No, that's not it.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.740
We just wanted to ask you something.

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:00.840
And I don't do battles...

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:05.550
But you have to, right?

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:07.620
The coins have limits.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:12.000
And isn't it really scary and nerve-wracking

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.960
to have to look for an opponent?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.970
Maybe I'll tell you a little more.

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:22.870
You thought you could get away, didn't you?

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:26.510
I'm telling you, it's useless.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:29.850
Imagine the network between 
me and the Selectors.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:35.070
"Never fight Homura Suzuko or Mikage Hanna."

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.210
Just kidding!

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:40.740
But I could do it if I wanted to.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:45.360
Well, I guess it's okay if you refuse.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.250
When you're cold to me,

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:50.600
it's that much more fun to chase you around.

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:52.620
Inexplicable.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.000
Why are you doing all this?

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:59.720
You see, I love the Selector battles.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.760
Even though you're not a Selector?

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.080
Correct.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:06.180
More specifically, the chemical reaction 
they cause, you might say.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.810
You've also seen it, right?

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:12.220
People changing as they're pushed 
into different situations.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:15.270
When I see people who don't know 
how to handle those changes,

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:18.040
I want to get close to them.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.620
See?

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:22.570
So let's work together, okay?

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:27.920
I...

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.060
Jeez...

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.230
You always show up at the
perfect time, Sumida-san.

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.760
Satomi!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.070
You're...

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:40.990
Acquaintance?

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:43.100
Please!

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.930
Introduce me to someone I can battle!

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:48.640
Come, now... Stop that, Sumida-san.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.240
You're making me look like the bad guy.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.850
Please! I'm begging you!

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:56.640
Well, I don't mind...

00:11:56.640 --> 00:12:00.250
But I believe I just set you up 
with one a few days ago.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:03.570
Oh, from the look of it, you lost?

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:06.360
What do you mean, "you lost"?!

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:08.300
You introduced them to me!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:10.120
You tricked me!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.320
Come on...

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.960
I'd never trick you, Sumida-san.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:17.350
I set you up with a match, just like you asked.

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:18.800
Am I wrong?

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.570
Thought so.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:24.050
I mean, lately, you're totally my type.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.550
You little...

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:28.120
Stop making fun of me!

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.350
You're so rough.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.660
If you like me,

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:36.400
then set me up with someone I can beat!

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.360
A girl!

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.710
A girl who isn't used to the game yet!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:39.400
No—

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.570
Very well.

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.740
In exchange,

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:47.320
make me obsess over you even more.

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:52.020
There's a girl who just joined.

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:53.880
There she is.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.630
Her name is Morikawa Chinatsu.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.500
Bookmaker 

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:00.040
Chi-chan?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.260
Chi-chan's a Selector?

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.190
Conjecture.

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:05.130
A friend?

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.600
I sent the meeting location to your phone.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:10.760
Thanks! See you!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:11.930
W-Wait!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.180
You shouldn't do that. It's dangerous.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:20.180
There's no telling what he might do now.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:20.860
Then...

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:24.070
Are you interfering with a battle I set up?

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:30.780
Sumida-san's life is on the line in this next battle.

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:34.420
That's why he looked so pathetic.

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:37.300
But you're different.

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:40.690
I don't like girls who can't pick up a clue.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.820
I'll enter your booking.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:56.530
So tell me where Chi-chan's battle is.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:01.490
Sure. That's fine.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:07.650
<b>Pedestrians and Bicycles Only</b>

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.540
Chi-chan...

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.960
Hanna-chan...

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.510
He might be dangerous.

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:21.110
I can go alone.

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:22.760
Fascinated.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:26.130
If I dropped out here, I wouldn't be Dr. Hanna!

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:30.010
What do you mean, "you lost"?!

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.160
You introduced them to me!

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:33.690
You tricked me!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.050
What do you mean, "you lost"?!

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:38.700
You introduced them to me!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:39.980
You tricked me!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:44.720
I loved the look on Sumida-san's face.

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:48.990
If I never see him again, I'll be really sad.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:53.490
But worst case, maybe those girls 
will make me feel better...

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:58.460
Homura Suzuko and Morikawa Chinatsu.

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:01.000
Huh? This park...

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.080
This is where the battle is?

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.800
Wow, what a coincidence!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.340
<i>I can't believe it's here...</i>

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:14.390
Discovery!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.180
It's the guy from earlier.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:18.930
Wait!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.950
Ow!

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:22.600
What the hell?

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:41.640
Chi-chan...

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.460
You're Chi-chan, right?

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:52.410
Chi-chan!

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.220
Um, listen... I...

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:04.140
Why are you interrupting my battle?!

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:04.900
Sumida-san?

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.230
I'm Morikawa Chinatsu.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.400
Time to take my virgin teenage girl!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.820
No!

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:12.700
Open!

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:21.040
Where is this?

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.190
Unusual.

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.560
A battle field?

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.750
When the battle space is deployed,

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.990
Selectors in the area are caught up in it.

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:30.140
Chi-chan!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.080
I go first, then.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:37.800
Ener Charge.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:39.520
Meru, grow.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:41.960
Meru?

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:43.770
Chi-chan...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.100
Summon Gyoz, Torochee.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:48.270
Turn end.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:52.980
She went and memorized all the basics, huh?

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:55.560
This is the best opponent I could've hoped for!

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.230
Y-You shouldn't let your guard down...

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:58.370
Shut up, ugly!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.660
But I know she's going to defend.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.420
Grow, Slow-ko.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.290
Aim for the gap.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.420
Everything else, full-out attack 
without building Ener!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.590
R-Roger!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:16.600
Endure it.

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.100
Yes, I'm fine.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.560
So fight the way you want, Chi-chan.

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.430
I will.

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.430
Ener Charge. Grow.

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:25.970
Send out two SIGNI.

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:27.350
Turn end.

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:28.500
Inexplicable.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.370
She's leaving her center open again.

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:33.320
Her LRIG will just keep getting hit that way.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.290
You've never played a game in your life!

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:38.740
Crap, what do I do to repay Satomi-san?

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.880
Maybe give him everything I have?

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:42.040
Chi-chan...

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:47.120
Why?

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:56.500
Didn't she care about what happened to Meru?

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:00.660
Hey, you're still holed up like a turtle?

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:05.480
Maybe you're the type that 
gets turned on by pain?

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:08.980
I love it when they're asking for it.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.860
I'll ram the best thing I have 
right through your hole!

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:13.270
Bet!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:17.820
Direct.

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.870
You'll take damage to your LRIG as pain!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:24.540
Twist that blank face of yours in pain,

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:28.510
and cry in a sweet voice!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:30.930
Chi-chan!

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:33.500
Nasty. I had no idea that was a skill.

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.880
I'm sorry!

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:46.540
Are you okay?

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.640
What about you?

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:49.760
I'm happy.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.820
Because this pain is the same as yours.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.940
Is that really Chi-chan?

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:01.100
Ice-cold.

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:04.490
Just what is your friend like?

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:09.140
Chi-chan is my goal in life.

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:12.440
Chi-chan is the girl I've always wanted to be.

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:14.040
But...

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:17.320
About time, isn't it?

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:18.220
Yes.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:20.110
Bet.

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:26.410
Berserk.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.480
Deploy Code Order Steak.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.290
Use Teaksauce to add the Lancer ability.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.600
Full attack.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.970
She just used her skill, too?

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:40.440
What is she planning to do?

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:42.070
What a pain.

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.670
Full attack!

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:46.420
U-Um, please calm down!

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.740
You can do it when you try, huh, ugly?

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:57.750
Beat the crap out of her!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.930
All right, turn end!

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:06.360
Fill the gap.

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:09.770
Turn end.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:13.200
You're still not done crying, you masochist?

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:16.200
Slow-ko, full attack in your attack phase!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:20.490
Hypothesis.

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:21.500
What are you doing, hag?

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:25.200
Perhaps her skill forces the opponent to attack.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:23.050
I can't fight anymore.

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:29.830
And once they realize they've been 
forced into a reckless move,

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:31.940
they have no way of attacking again.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:36.420
Please!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.950
Give me a do-over!

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:39.110
I'm begging you!

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:40.120
Let me go!

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:41.710
I'll do anything!

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:43.720
ARTS.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:48.430
Don't you know what happens 
when you lose battles?

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:50.640
Meru, full attack.

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:57.180
Damn it!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:09.660
Question.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:10.440
Are you...

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:14.890
S-Sorry... Sorry! Sorry!

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:16.680
Confirmation.

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:20.540
When a Selector loses all their 
coins, the LRIG takes over.

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.380
This park brings back memories, doesn't it?

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:26.800
It hasn't changed.

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:30.820
Everything is like it used to be.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:36.340
I'm happy to see you again, Chi-chan.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.470
I feel the same way, Suzu.

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:40.360
Chi-chan!

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:42.480
I really am...

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:52.980
glad to see you.

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:27.400
Inside me...

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:29.170
I've never forgotten!

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:31.080
Not for a moment after we said goodbye!

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:32.400
We are Selectors.

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:35.980
There are always winners and losers.

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:37.900
Why do we have to fight?

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:37.900
Goodbye.

00:23:37.900 --> 00:23:40.980
Next time: Friend / Bonds and Chains.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:40.980
Friend / Bonds and Chains
